let __v_428 = Value::from("A rabbit is an eight to ten year commitment and not a hutch pet: it needs a run it can stand up and stretch in, hay every day, another rabbit for company, and a vet who treats rabbits, because they hide illness until they are very ill. The daily work is the cleaning out and the company, and a rabbit kept alone in a small hutch is a miserable animal. A child can enjoy a rabbit but cannot be the one who cleans it out or notices it has stopped eating, so that job is an adult's. Get one because you want a rabbit for that long.");
